    <string name="simple_section_reader_mode">Reader mode</string>
    <string name="simple_reader_mode_tips">When on, pinch with two fingers to zoom the wallpaper (no minimum, you can zoom out to reveal blank margins) and drag with two fingers to pan it. Double tap or the reset button restores default size/position. Each wallpaper remembers its own zoom/position. Only works if your launcher forwards multi-touch gestures to the wallpaper.</string>
