    <string name="simple_reader_section_paging">Section-by-section paging</string>
    <string name="simple_reader_section_paging_tips">When on (default), if a wallpaper is zoomed beyond the screen, next/prev first pages through it section by section before moving to the actual next/prev wallpaper. When off, next/prev always jumps straight to the actual next/prev wallpaper, no matter how zoomed in the current one is.</string>
